model "test reformulation example"
 uses "advmod", "mmsystem"

 public declarations
  x: array(1..2) of mpvar
 end-declarations

 implies(x(1)>=10, x(1)+x(2)>=12 and not x(2)<=5 )

 setparam("XPRS_loadnames",true)
 loadprob(0)
 writeprob("tmp:mat", "l")          ! Display in LP-format
 fcopy("tmp:mat",0,"",F_APPEND)

end-model

Output:

Subject To
_R1: _C8=0 ->  x(2) >= 5.002004
_R2: _C7 + _C8 = 1
_R3: _C5=1 ->  _C7 >= 1
_R4: _C5=1 ->  _C6 >= 1
_R5: _C4=0 ->  x(1) <= 9.997996
_R6: _C3=1 ->  _C4 - _C5 <= 0
_R7: _C3 = 1
_R8: _C6=1 ->  x(1) + x(2) >= 12

Binaries
_C3 _C4 _C5 _C6 _C7 _C8
